      "content": {
        "content_kind": "text",
        "payload": {
          "title": "A thin bar, wherever it sits",
          "body": "When it is collapsed on any edge or between two panes, the sidebar is a slim bar of icons. Open it and its list shows as a column you can read, even on a phone. It keeps the same gap from the edge and the same rounded corners as your panes."
